arXiv:2608.02609v1 Announce Type: new 
Abstract: Half a million cuneiform clay tablets survive in museums worldwide, yet modern users can neither read nor write in the world&#x27;s oldest writing system, leaving a 4,000-year cultural barrier that existing NLP tools have only partially addressed.
